@startuml core-flow-sequence
!theme plain
autonumber
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 11

title LUỒNG NGHIỆP VỤ TRỤ CỘT: TẠO ĐƠN - THANH TOÁN - PHUN HƯƠNG TỰ ĐỘNG

actor "Khách hàng Kiosk" as Customer
participant "API Gateway\n(:8080)" as Gateway
participant "Order Service\n(:8083)" as OrderSvc
participant "Identity Service\n(:8081)" as IdentitySvc
participant "Machine Service\n(:8084)" as MachineSvc
participant "Catalog Service\n(:8082)" as CatalogSvc
database "order_db" as OrderDB
participant "Cổng thanh toán" as PaymentGw
participant "Kiosk Hardware" as Hardware

== GIAI ĐOẠN 1: TẠO ĐƠN HÀNG AUTHORITATIVE ==
Customer -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/orders\n{tenantId: "1", machineId: "10", slotId: "2", items: [{productId: 202, unitPrice: 50000}]}
activate Gateway
Gateway -> OrderSvc: Forward POST /api/v1/orders
activate OrderSvc

OrderSvc -> IdentitySvc: POST /internal/v1/identity/introspect (Validate Bearer Token)
activate IdentitySvc
IdentitySvc --> OrderSvc: 200 OK (IdentityPrincipal: id: 101, tenantId: 1, grants: ["KIOSK_ORDER"])
deactivate IdentitySvc

OrderSvc -> MachineSvc: GET /internal/machines/10/slots/2?tenantId=1\n(Header: X-Internal-Service-Key)
activate MachineSvc
MachineSvc --> OrderSvc: OrderMachineSlotResponse\n{machineAvailable: true, slotAvailable: true, productId: "202"}
deactivate MachineSvc

OrderSvc -> CatalogSvc: GET /internal/catalog/order-products/202?tenantId=1\n(Header: X-Internal-Service-Key)
activate CatalogSvc
CatalogSvc --> OrderSvc: OrderProductSnapshotResponse\n{productId: 202, name: "Bleu de Chanel", available: true, unitPrice: 50000}
deactivate CatalogSvc

OrderSvc -> OrderSvc: Đối soát dữ liệu Authoritative:\n1. Giá Client gửi == unitPrice từ Catalog\n2. Sản phẩm đúng với cấu hình Slot\n3. Máy ONLINE & Slot AVAILABLE
OrderSvc -> OrderDB: INSERT INTO orders (status='PENDING', total_amount=50000, expires_at=NOW()+15m)\nINSERT INTO order_items (...)
activate OrderDB
OrderDB --> OrderSvc: Saved Order (ID = 9001)
deactivate OrderDB

OrderSvc --> Gateway: 201 Created {orderId: 9001, status: "PENDING", totalAmount: 50000}
deactivate OrderSvc
Gateway --> Customer: 201 Created {orderId: 9001}
deactivate Gateway

== GIAI ĐOẠN 2: TẠO MÃ QR VÀ QUÉT THANH TOÁN ==
Customer -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/orders/9001/payments/qr (Lấy mã QR)
activate Gateway
Gateway -> OrderSvc: Forward POST /api/v1/orders/9001/payments/qr
activate OrderSvc
OrderSvc -> OrderDB: INSERT INTO payments (reference='PAY-XYZ', order_id=9001, amount=50000, status='PENDING')
OrderSvc --> Gateway: 200 OK {reference: 'PAY-XYZ', qrPayload: 'scentstation://pay/...'}
deactivate OrderSvc
Gateway --> Customer: 200 OK (Hiển thị mã QR VietQR)
deactivate Gateway

Customer -> PaymentGw: Quét mã trên App Ngân hàng & Chuyển tiền

== GIAI ĐOẠN 3: WEBHOOK CALLBACK VÀ ĐIỀU PHỐI PHUN HƯƠNG ==
PaymentGw -> Gateway: POST /api/v1/payments/callback\n{eventId: 'EVT-888', reference: 'PAY-XYZ', orderId: 9001, amount: 50000, status: 'PAID'}\n(Header: X-Payment-Callback-Token)
activate Gateway
Gateway -> OrderSvc: Forward Callback
activate OrderSvc

OrderSvc -> OrderSvc: verifyCallbackToken() & Chống trùng lặp qua eventId
OrderSvc -> OrderDB: UPDATE payments SET status='PAID', paid_at=NOW()\nUPDATE orders SET status='CONFIRMED'\nINSERT INTO payment_callback_events (event_id, outcome='ACCEPTED')
OrderSvc -> OrderDB: INSERT INTO dispensing_commands (command_id: UUID, status='REQUESTED')

OrderSvc -> MachineSvc: POST /api/machines/dispense-commands\n{commandId: UUID, orderId: "9001", machineId: 10, slotId: "2"}
activate MachineSvc

MachineSvc -> Hardware: Kích xung điện bơm màng (Relay Pulse)
activate Hardware
Hardware --> MachineSvc: Cảm biến lưu lượng xác nhận phun thành công
deactivate Hardware

MachineSvc --> OrderSvc: 200 OK {commandId: UUID, status: 'DISPENSED'}
deactivate MachineSvc

OrderSvc -> OrderDB: UPDATE dispensing_commands SET status='DISPENSED'\nUPDATE orders SET status='DISPENSED'

OrderSvc --> Gateway: 200 OK {"message": "Callback processed"}
deactivate OrderSvc
Gateway --> PaymentGw: 200 OK
deactivate Gateway

== GIAI ĐOẠN 4: KHÁCH HÀNG NHẬN HƯƠNG TẠI KIOSK ==
Customer -> Hardware: Đặt cổ tay tại vòi xịt và nhận tia nước hoa!

@enduml
